{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2e23c748-be78-8378-a4c4-297102c6153c",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:07:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:04:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. So, um, I'm calling about my trash bin. Or, well, my recycling bin, I think. I mean, it's the big one with the wheels, right? You know the kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, the rolling cart. What happened to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone. I put it out at the curb last night for the pickup, and the truck came this morning, and now there's no bin. Not tipped over, not down the street, just gone. I looked, you know, up and down both sides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could be the crew took it by mistake, or it got carried off in the wind. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 325 Admiral Kalbfus Road. In the North End. Are you, uh, are you getting that? Three twenty-five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-five Admiral Kalbfus, got it. Was it the trash cart or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that's where I get mixed up. Is the recycling one the blue one? Or is blue the trash? I thought the lid color meant something, but I mean, mine had a, a green top, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, lid colors can vary. Let me ask it another way. What did you put in it, bottles and cardboard, or regular household garbage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bottles, cans, cardboard. Recycling. Right, so it was recycling. But then is Wednesday recycling or is that every other week? Because I put it out and they did come, so I guess it was the week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the truck came, it was your week. I'll put in a request for a replacement cart and a note that it went missing after pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. And is there a fee for that? Because I didn't, I mean, I didn't lose it. It disappeared. Do I have to pay for a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally if it's missing or damaged by the collection, there's no charge, but I'll have the supervisor confirm that when they call you. Is this the best number, the one you're on now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0185. That's my cell. Um, can they do it fast? Sorry, it's just that, so my son's school choir has a holiday program on the fifteenth, and we've got people coming over after, so I need the bin cleared out before then. I know, holiday in March, it's a rescheduled thing, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The fifteenth is eleven days out, so that should be plenty of time. Usually it's a few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, just to check, I don't do anything? I don't call anybody else, or fill out something online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing else. I've got the request in. Someone will call you, and the cart gets delivered to the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. And in the meantime, do I just, like, use a barrel? Or is that not allowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For one week you can put the recycling out in a sturdy box or a barrel, just mark it recycling. Cardboard gets flattened and bundled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a box. Marked. I think I got it. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. McCarthy. Take care."
    }
  ],
